      <a class="card" href="/legal/terms/"><h3>Terms</h3><p>Using the site, links to YouTube and Udemy, no outcome promises.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/legal/ai-disclosure/"><h3>AI disclosure</h3><p>How AI is used to make ADITEJUS lessons.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
